{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "396fe986-36da-4318-a1da-648a7ba4df2f",
    "name": "Gamification API",
    "description": "This API allows you to add gamification to your project in a simple way. You can manage players and give points and badges to players when some events are raised.\n\nEvery request must carry the application credentials in the HTTP headers:\n- `apiKey`\n- `apiPassword`\n\nThe only exception is `POST /application`, which registers the first application.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "1608680"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Applications",
      "description": "All operations related to the application resource are in this section. The application is the entry point of the API. All other resources are linked to an application. Each application has a unique apiKey and apiPassword. Those are used for authentication and must be passed on every request (in the HTTP headers).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get list of applications",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/applications",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["applications"]
            },
            "description": "Get the applications registered on the server.\n\nUse valid apiKey and apiPassword credentials in the HTTP headers to access this resource. Only the public information (id, name and description) of each application is returned.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200\n\nBODY\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 0,\n      \"name\": \"\",\n      \"description\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create a new application",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Gamification Demo\",\n    \"description\": \"Gamification Demo for customer X\",\n    \"apiKey\": \"GamificationDemo\",\n    \"apiPassword\": \"password\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": { "language": "json" }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/application",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["application"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new application. This is the first thing you must do to use this API.\n\nProvide a name, a description and a unique apiKey and a secure apiPassword.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 201\n\nBODY\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"status\": \"created\",\n  \"url\": \"/application/1\",\n  \"id\": 1\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get application",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/application",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["application"]
            },
            "description": "Get the information of the application linked to the apiKey and apiPassword in the HTTP headers. Returns the name, description and apiKey of the application.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200\n\nBODY\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"name\": \"\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"apiKey\": \"\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update application information",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Gamification Demo\",\n    \"description\": \"Gamification Demo for customer X\",\n    \"apiKey\": \"GamificationDemo\",\n    \"apiPassword\": \"password\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": { "language": "json" }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/application",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["application"]
            },
            "description": "Update the information of your application. You can update all information, including apiKey and apiPassword.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete an application",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/application",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["application"]
            },
            "description": "Delete an application. Be careful: deleting an application deletes all related resources in cascade.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Players",
      "description": "All operations related to the player resource are in this section. The player is a user of the application; he can win points and badges when events are happening.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get list of players",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/players",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["players"]
            },
            "description": "Gets the list of all players of the application.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200\n\nBODY\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 0,\n      \"firstName\": \"\",\n      \"lastName\": \"\",\n      \"email\": \"\",\n      \"numberOfPoints\": 0\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add a new player",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"firstName\": \"Max\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Power\",\n    \"email\": \"max.power@gmail.com\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": { "language": "json" }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/players",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["players"]
            },
            "description": "Adds a new player to the application with his basic information. Returns the new player's id.\n\nTo manage points and badges, please go to the events resource.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 201\n\nBODY\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"status\": \"created\",\n  \"url\": \"/players/1\",\n  \"id\": 1\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get player details",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/players/1",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["players", "1"]
            },
            "description": "Gets the information about a specific player, including the numberOfPoints and the list of all his badges.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200\n\nBODY\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"id\": 0,\n  \"firstName\": \"\",\n  \"lastName\": \"\",\n  \"email\": \"\",\n  \"numberOfPoints\": 0,\n  \"badges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 0,\n      \"name\": \"\",\n      \"description\": \"\",\n      \"icon\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get player badges",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/players/1/badges",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["players", "1", "badges"]
            },
            "description": "Gets all badges of a specific player.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200\n\nBODY\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"playerId\": 0,\n  \"badges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 0,\n      \"name\": \"\",\n      \"description\": \"\",\n      \"icon\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update player information",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"firstName\": \"John\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Doe\",\n    \"email\": \"john.doe@gmail.com\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": { "language": "json" }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/players/1",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["players", "1"]
            },
            "description": "Updates the information of a player.\n\nThe points and badges can only be updated by events.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete a player",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/players/1",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["players", "1"]
            },
            "description": "Deletes a player from the application. All events linked to the player are deleted in cascade.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Badges",
      "description": "All operations related to the badge resource are in this section. A badge is a distinction, won by a player when he does something significant (an event).",
      "item": [
