            "description": "Gets the badges of the application.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200\n\nBODY\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 0,\n      \"name\": \"\",\n      \"description\": \"\",\n      \"icon\": \"\",\n      \"categoryId\": 0\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add a new badge",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
