    {
      "name": "Rules",
      "description": "All operations related to the rule resource are in this section. A rule defines when badges or points should be granted to a player. Many rules can be created for the same event type.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get list of rules",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/rules",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["rules"]
            },
            "description": "Gets the rules defined for the application.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200\n\nBODY\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 0,\n      \"badgeId\": 0,\n      \"numberOfPoints\": 0,\n      \"eventTypeId\": 0,\n      \"eventTypeName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n- 401 — invalid or missing apiKey/apiPassword headers (ProblemDetails)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add a new rule",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
