            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"badgeId\": 1,\n    \"numberOfPoints\": 10,\n    \"eventTypeId\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": { "language": "json" }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/rules",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["rules"]
            },
            "description": "Adds a new rule for the application. The badgeId is optional, the numberOfPoints is required but can be set to 0. Returns the new rule's id.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 201\n\nBODY\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"status\": \"created\",\n  \"url\": \"/rules/1\",\n  \"id\": 1\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get rule details",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
