          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update rule information",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"badgeId\": 1,\n    \"numberOfPoints\": 20,\n    \"eventTypeId\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": { "language": "json" }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/rules/1",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["rules", "1"]
            },
            "description": "Updates the information of the given rule. This doesn't change badges and points given to players on past events.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete a rule",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/rules/1",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["rules", "1"]
            },
            "description": "Deletes a rule from the application. This doesn't remove badges and points given to players on past events.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Events",
      "description": "All operations related to the event resource are in this section. Everything that has to be monitored by the gamification platform is recorded as an event and has to be posted to the gamification API. When something happens to a player or when a player does something, an event should be created. An event is linked to a player and is of a type. Multiple events of the same type and player can be created. An event can't be updated or deleted.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get list of events",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/events",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["events"]
            },
            "description": "Gets the list of all events registered on the gamification server for the application.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200\n\nBODY\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 0,\n      \"playerId\": 0,\n      \"eventTypeId\": 0,\n      \"eventTypeName\": \"\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add a new event",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"playerId\": 1,\n    \"eventTypeId\": 1,\n    \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-25T10:00:00Z\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": { "language": "json" }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/events",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["events"]
            },
            "description": "Registers a new event on the gamification platform for the application. When an event is created, the rules are browsed and the corresponding points and badges are given to the player. If a badge is already won by the player, nothing happens. Returns the event's id.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 201\n\nBODY\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"status\": \"created\",\n  \"url\": \"/events/1\",\n  \"id\": 1\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get event details",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apiKey", "value": "GamificationDemo", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "apiPassword", "value": "password", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://localhost:5001/events/1",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5001",
              "path": ["events", "1"]
            },
            "description": "Gets detailed information about a specific event identified by its id.\n\n**Response**\n\n- 200\n\nBODY\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"id\": 0,\n  \"playerId\": 0,\n  \"eventTypeId\": 0,\n  \"eventTypeName\": \"\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
